{"questions":[{"question_id":"EfO027qCULPdiAND","paperTitle":"IIT-JEE 2011 Paper 1 Offline","year":2011,"examDate":2011,"subject":"chemistry","chapter":"structure-of-atom","chapterGroup":"physical-chemistry","topic":"quantum-numbers-and-orbitals","type":"integer","marks":2,"negMarks":0,"permalink":"the-maximum-number-of-electrons-that-can-have-principal-quan-2011-marks-2-efo027qculpdiand.htm","content":"The maximum number of electrons that can have principal quantum number, n = 3, and spin quantum number, m<sub>s</sub> = − 1/2 , is","options":[],"correct_options":[],"explanation":"<p>To answer this question, we need to consider the quantum numbers that describe electrons in atoms. Each electron in an atom is described by four quantum numbers:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\n<li>The principal quantum number (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.357ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 600 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) dictates the energy level and size of the electron orbital.</li>\n\n<li>The azimuthal (angular momentum) quantum number (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.674ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 298 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) defines the shape of the orbital. For a given <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.357ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 600 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.674ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 298 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> can take any integer value from 0 to <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.254ex\" height=\"1.692ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -666 2322.4 748\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(822.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1822.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</li>\n\n<li>The magnetic quantum number (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.357ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.651ex\" height=\"1.357ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 1171.7 599.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(911,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) describes the orientation of the orbital in space. For a given <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.674ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 298 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.357ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.651ex\" height=\"1.357ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 1171.7 599.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(911,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> can take values from <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.434ex\" height=\"1.756ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 1076 776\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> to <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.434ex\" height=\"1.756ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 1076 776\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, including zero.</li>\n\n<li>The spin quantum number (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.355ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.925ex\" height=\"1.355ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 1292.6 599.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(911,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) describes the direction of the electron's spin and can have a value of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.556ex\" height=\"2.737ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 1571.6 1209.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> or <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.556ex\" height=\"2.737ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 1571.6 1209.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</li>\n\n</ol>\n\n<p>Given the principal quantum number, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.506ex\" height=\"1.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -665 2433.6 687\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(877.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1933.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, and the spin quantum number, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.497ex\" height=\"2.737ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 4197.7 1209.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(911,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1570.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2626.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(3404.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, we need to calculate the maximum number of electrons that can fit this criteria.</p>\n\n<p>For <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.506ex\" height=\"1.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -665 2433.6 687\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(877.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1933.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, the possible values of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.674ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 298 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> are 0, 1, and 2 (s, p, and d orbitals respectively). Here's how the orbitals break down:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>When <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.823ex\" height=\"1.62ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 2131.6 716\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(575.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1631.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> (the 3s orbital), <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.357ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.799ex\" height=\"1.864ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -666 3005.3 823.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(911,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1449.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2505.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, so there's 1 orbital.</li>\n\n<li>When <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.823ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 2131.6 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(575.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1631.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> (the 3p orbitals), <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.357ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.651ex\" height=\"1.357ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 1171.7 599.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(911,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> can be -1, 0, or +1, providing 3 orbitals.</li>\n\n<li>When <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.823ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 2131.6 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(575.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1631.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> (the 3d orbitals), <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.357ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.651ex\" height=\"1.357ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 1171.7 599.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(911,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> can be -2, -1, 0, +1, or +2, giving 5 orbitals.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<p>Each orbital can hold 2 electrons with opposite spins. Since we are specifically looking for electrons with <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.497ex\" height=\"2.737ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 4197.7 1209.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(911,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1570.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2626.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(3404.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, we can only count one electron per orbital. Therefore, we sum the total number of orbitals across the s, p, and d sublevels for <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.506ex\" height=\"1.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -665 2433.6 687\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(877.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1933.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>:</p>\n\n<p>3s: 1 orbital <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 1 electron (with <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.497ex\" height=\"2.737ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 4197.7 1209.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(911,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1570.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2626.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(3404.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) = 1 electron<br>\n\n<p>3p: 3 orbitals <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 1 electron (with <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.497ex\" height=\"2.737ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 4197.7 1209.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(911,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1570.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2626.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(3404.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) = 3 electrons<br></p>\n\n<p>3d: 5 orbitals <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 1 electron (with <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.497ex\" height=\"2.737ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 4197.7 1209.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(911,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1570.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2626.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(3404.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) = 5 electrons</p></p>\n\n<p>If we sum these, we get:</p>\n\n<p>1 + 3 + 5 = 9 electrons</p>\n\n<p>Thus, the maximum number of electrons that can have the principal quantum number <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.506ex\" height=\"1.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -665 2433.6 687\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(877.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1933.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and the spin quantum number <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.497ex\" height=\"2.737ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 4197.7 1209.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(911,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1570.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2626.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(3404.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><rect width=\"553.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is 9.</p>"}]}